<view class="page {{theme}}"><view class="heading">随笔</view><view class="section-copy intro">照片之外，留下拍摄时的观察与记忆。</view><loading-state loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" bind:retry="load"/><view class="journal-empty" wx:if="{{!loading&&!error&&!posts.length}}"><view class="section-title">文字还在整理</view><view class="empty-copy">拍摄时的观察与记忆，会陆续写在这里。现在可以先从相册，看看已经留下的影像。</view><button class="button primary" bindtap="openAlbum">先浏览相册 →</button><view wx:if="{{album.cover}}" class="representative" bindtap="openRepresentative"><progressive-image photo="{{album.cover}}" height="{{album.cover.fullCardHeight+'rpx'}}" clear-size="1600"/><view class="representative-caption">{{album.title}} · {{album.count}} 张作品</view></view></view><view class="post-list"><view class="post glass" wx:for="{{posts}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="card-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="excerpt">{{item.excerpt}}</view><view class="card-meta">{{item.dateText}} · 阅读随笔 →</view></view></view></view>
